  - Hugging Face LeRobot (Apache-2.0) — git submodule at lerobot/
  - box2ai-robotics joycon-robotics (MIT) — git submodule; optional Joy-Con teleop
  - DeepMind MuJoCo (Apache-2.0) — physics simulation
